  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Michael Myers Resplendent** (1 review): Reviewer says Heretic Pride appears in the tracklist but seems absent from the audio files [2]\n- **Dance Music** (1 review): The reviewer says the missing Heretic Pride track is inside the Dance Music file because the track wasn't split [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Idylls of the King**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Doc Gooden**: back after 87 archived shows (875 days); rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Possum by Night**: back after 130 archived shows (1791 days) [4]\n- **We Were Patriots**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **No Children intro (jazz)**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2024-10-12** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 20 songs; 96 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: physical condition [1]\n- Reviewer says the uncut track turned out a pleasant surprise, much as the song was a surprise at the show [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2024-10-12**: taped by Tape&Bake (formerly lmgbtapes); transferred by Tape&Bake (formerly lmgbtapes); source: [SBD + AUD Matrix: DPA 4060s (Healy on stage) > Tascam FR-AV2 + SBD > Tascam FR-AV2] [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by 91.3 WYEP: [The Mountain Goats](https://www.wyep.org/wyep-pittsburgh-concert-calendar/event/the-mountain-goats-09-08-2024-18-32-09) [5]\n- Poster by 91.3 WYEP: [The Mountain Goats](https://www.wyep.org/wyep-pittsburgh-concert-calendar/event/the-mountain-goats-09-08-2024-18-32-09) [6]\n- Poster by Mr Smalls: [The Mountain Goats Rule of Three Tour | Mr Smalls](https://mrsmalls.com/events/peter-hughes-and-john-darnielle-as-the-mountain-goats-duo/) [7]",
